<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Booking Invoice</title>
    <style>
      * {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
        color: #333333;
        line-height: 1.6;
      }

      .email-wrapper {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 40px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      .email-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a73e8 0%, #0d47a1 100%);
        padding: 40px 32px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .email-header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 26px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.3px;
      }

      .email-header p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 600;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 4px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        margin-top: 14px;
      }

      .email-body {
        padding: 40px 32px;
      }

      .greeting {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #1a1a1a;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }

      .message {
        font-size: 15px;
        color: #555555;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .summary-card {
        background-color: #f8faff;
        border: 1px solid #dde8ff;
        border-radius: 10px;
        overflow: hidden;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .summary-card-header {
        background-color: #1a73e8;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 10px 20px;
      }

      .summary-table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
      }

      .summary-table tr {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eef1f8;
      }

      .summary-table tr:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }

      .summary-table td {
        padding: 13px 20px;
        font-size: 14px;
      }

      .summary-table td:first-child {
        color: #888888;
        font-weight: 500;
        width: 45%;
      }

      .summary-table td:last-child {
        color: #1a1a1a;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .total-row td {
        background-color: #eef4ff;
      }

      .total-row td:last-child {
        color: #1a73e8;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .attachment-notice {
        display: flex;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 14px;
        background-color: #e8f5e9;
        border-left: 4px solid #43a047;
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 14px 18px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .attachment-icon {
        font-size: 22px;
        line-height: 1;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .attachment-notice p {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #2e7d32;
      }

      .attachment-notice strong {
        display: block;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }

      .divider {
        border: none;
        border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        margin: 28px 0;
      }

      .closing-note {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #888888;
      }

      .email-footer {
        background-color: #f4f6f9;
        padding: 24px 32px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .email-footer p {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #999999;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }

      .email-footer a {
        color: #1a73e8;
        text-decoration: none;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="email-wrapper">
      <div class="email-header">
        <h1>Tour Management System</h1>
        <p>Payment Confirmation &amp; Invoice</p>
        <span class="badge">Booking Confirmed</span>
      </div>

      <div class="email-body">
        <p class="greeting">Hello, <%= username %></p>

        <p class="message">
          Great news! Your payment was successful and your booking is confirmed.
          Here is a summary of your reservation. A detailed PDF invoice is
          attached to this email for your records.
        </p>

        <div class="attachment-notice">
          <span class="attachment-icon">&#128206;</span>
          <div>
            <strong>Invoice Attached</strong>
            <p>
              Your full invoice (invoice.pdf) is attached to this email. Please
              keep it for your records.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <hr class="divider" />

        <p class="closing-note">
          If you have any questions about your booking, please don't hesitate to
          reach out to our support team. We look forward to providing you with
          an unforgettable tour experience!
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="email-footer">
        <p>
          &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Tour Management System. All
          rights reserved.
        </p>
        <p>
          Need help?
          <a href="mailto:support@tourmanagement.com">Contact Support</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
